# Every checkout is byte-identical to the repository: no line-ending conversion, ever.
# Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote assets whose SHA-256
# ATTRIBUTION.md records and the patches vendored under libs/.
* -text

# Not text at all: no textual diffs or merges either.
*.pdf binary
*.pfb binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.otf binary
*.icc binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.tiff binary
*.webp binary
*.ppm binary
*.atn binary
*.pat binary
*.bin binary
*.wasm binary
*.gz binary
